# ...and the ingested vendor CSV (9 MB). Committed so deploys and CI get AAPL's
# 2021-23 history without touching git LFS (the 195 MB CSV is LFS; its 1 GB/mo
# bandwidth quota would be exhausted by a week of daily redeploys).
!data/vendor/aapl_2021_2023.parquet
